 "name": "Aerokinesis",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/disaster-storms.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Storms of Disaster</em></p>\n<p>Through training and understanding, you have found new applications for your storms. You gain the one of the following (You can select this feat multiple times):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Suffocation</strong>. As an action for 2 cursed energy, you target a creature within 30 ft that you can see. They must make a Constitution saving throw, taking your proficiency bonus in d6s of necrotic damage and start suffocating on a failed save. While suffocating their movement is halved and their attack rolls have disadvantage. If you are more than 30 ft away or lose concentration, the target stops suffocating.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Resistance to lightning and thunder damage.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
